/E ( The Sokovia Accords are a set of legal documents that call for the establishment of a system that regulates the activities of enhanced individuals in the MCU \(Marvel Cinematic Universe\). The Accords were introduced after a series of tragic events that were caused by enhanced individuals all over the world, and caused the death of innocent civilians. The Accords called for all enhanced individuals to operate under the supervision of the United Nations and for organizations such as The Avengers to no longer be a private organization. The accords were introduced by the United Nations and were ratified by 172 nations.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
