149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E ( The Battle of New York was the major and decisive battle of the Chitauri Invasion in Manhattan, New York City, in which the Avengers were able to defeat Loki and his Chitauri army and prevent his plans of conquering Earth. The Incident is considered a monumental event in human history, and it publicly confirmed the existence of extraterrestrials to Earth's citizens. There was a widespread feeling of gratitude not only towards the Avengers but to the emergency responders who perished during the battle but had helped prevent a significant loss of human life. As a result, a monument for them was erected above Grand Central Terminal. However, there were people who had less positive perspectives on the Avengers. Senator Boynton publicly called for the regulation of people with superpowers, while Senator Ellen Nadeer, whose mother was killed at the beginning of the battle, grew to hate aliens, causing her to publicly state her hate for all non-humans.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
