151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (The war began when HYDRA, which had infiltrated S.H.I.E.L.D., attempted to activate a mass destruction system it called Project Insight. This system aimed to identify millions of people \(heroes, scientists, politicians\) who could pose a threat to HYDRA's ideology using an advanced algorithm, even before they took any action, and simultaneously eliminate them using three massive Helicarriers. The Avengers were once again able to stop the threat, but in the process, Black Widow leaked all of S.H.I.E.L.D. and HYDRA's classified files onto the internet. This exposed the identities of all spies worldwide and revealed secret experiments \(such as the Winter Soldier project\). This situation sparked massive outrage in the United Nations and multiple government bodies, since this showed that the Avengers operated without consulting anyone and are capable of exposing government secrets.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
